Project Invisible FIBO

preset.py derives from the Project Invisible Ideogram 4 extension's
pi_ideogram_forge/legacy_preset.py, distributed under Apache License 2.0.

This extension uses installed Hugging Face libraries and includes the pinned
Apache-2.0 BRIA/Hugging Face FIBO 2.0 inference modules recorded in
forge_fibo2/vendor/PROVENANCE.json. Their copyright and license headers remain
in each file. Local compatibility changes include imports and attention dtype
restoration for official repacks. Model weights retain their own licenses and
are not bundled with the extension source.

pi_fibo_lib/vendor/degrid_core.py is the unmodified pure-PyTorch core from
lunaaispace-eng/ComfyUI-DeGrid, commit 5699bc33f71e1be12523fdea105cc9c2abfe1cd0.
Apache License 2.0 is preserved in pi_fibo_lib/vendor/LICENSE; provenance is
recorded in pi_fibo_lib/vendor/SOURCE.txt. Only the integration wrapper is new.
